  "question": {
    "text": "Three numbers are chosen at random without replacement from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>}</mo></math>. The probability that their minimum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>, given that their maximum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>, is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "DcUAn",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>",
